Sample fixtures are generated by `python3 Scripts/generate_fixtures.py`.

The generated `sample.epub`, `sample.pdf` and `sample.wav` are intentionally not
committed. They are regenerated automatically by:

  * the Xcode pre-build phase declared in App/project.yml, and
  * the GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/ios.yml).

To regenerate manually (works on Windows, macOS and Linux):

  python3 Scripts/generate_fixtures.py

If Python is unavailable, the app still runs; the Library screen falls back to
remote URLs and shows a banner explaining that local fixtures are missing.
